{{DISPLAYTITLE:A Colossal New Year!}}
'''A Colossal New Year!''' (ことよろにゃ強襲！(ΦωΦ), ''Koto Yoro nya Kyōshū! (ΦωΦ)'', '''Kotoyoronya Assault! (ΦωΦ)''') is a New Year's stage added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features [[Snache Doge]] and [[Sunrise Doge]].

==Overview==
===About===
A Colossal New Year! contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a stage includes [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[A Colossal New Year! (2024)/Year of the Snake Lv.1~10|A Colossal New Year!/Year of the Snake Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*A Colossal New Year! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

